TITLE Calcite kinetics, pH 2, 200 C, Cu and Ba, pe 4
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 30
    -water 1

KNOBS
    -iterations 1000

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 0.6
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true
    -molalities CO2
END
